{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 167496, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 122948, "uid": 107952, "type": 4, "title": "【客户端相关】游戏运行优化方法汇总", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1663346243, "updated_at": 1688968618, "updated_uid": 107952, "comment_at": 1679204104, "last_at": 1691409263, "comment_count": 17, "status": 1, "summary": "前言本帖主要汇总游戏客户端的各类优化的方法。乱斗ds预设暂时解决方法官方已解决，这里仅做记录可以不看了，换号可以参考目前有两种解决方法一、删除游戏cfg文件安卓需要root权限；iso需要越狱并安装A", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1170/h_2532/202/107952/2022/8/16/906156.PNG,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1170/h_1975/202/107952/2022/8/16/643317.PNG", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 10, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 10645, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 4, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 167496, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">前言</span></span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp;本帖主要汇总游戏客户端的各类优化的方法。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title4\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">乱斗ds预设暂时解决方法</span></span></span></span></div></div></div></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">官方已解决，这里仅做记录可以不看了，换号可以参考</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;目前有两种解决方法</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;一、删除游戏cfg文件</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">安卓需要root权限；iso需要越狱并安装AFC2和FILZA两个插件</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; root/越狱 的具体方法自行百度</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div></span><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;方法：</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;先进入游戏保存并设置好ds预设，顺便把小技能也设置好</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;大退游戏</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 进入游戏目录</div><div style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 安卓国际服：<span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"></span>Android/data/com.linegames.dcglobal/files</div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 安卓TAP服：<span style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">Android/data/</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\">com.linegames.dcglobal.xsolla</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">/</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">files</span></span></span></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\">&nbsp;IOS:<span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">-/var/mobile/containers/data/application/</span><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">*1</span><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">/library/ApplicationSupport/<span style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">com.linegames.dcglobal</span>/</span><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">dc</span></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"min-height-wrapper\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;min-height:20px;\"><b data-reset=\"true\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:15px;text-align:-webkit-center;font-weight:bold;\"><div data-reset=\"true\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">&nbsp;</span></div></b></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;min-height:1px;\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:13.9999px;\"><font size=\"3\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;*1 是随机字母及数字、必须找到包含此游戏的正确文件夹，可以直接用filza管理器搜索</font></div></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;删除：</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">!config.sav</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\">和</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">!config_sys.sav</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;害怕出问题的提前备份！</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"></div></span></span><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;删除这两个文件以后需要重新登陆！应该没人用游客账户了吧- -&nbsp;</span></div></span><div style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;（应该都用上免费而且可以在任意设备注册的不用挂魔法的apple id登录了吧！！）</span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;（你平时想换号也可以直接删<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">!config.sav这个文件</span>）&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;二、重新下载游戏</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;方法：</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;先进入游戏保存并设置好ds预设，顺便把小技能也设置好</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;大退游戏</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;删掉游戏确保没有残留文件，害怕有残留的重启手机？</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;然后重装游戏</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;之后进入游戏</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">不要再动ds设置</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:700;\">系统依旧保存了你之前的ds预设，如果没有你上次保存好的预设可以尝试自己再次设置，一般来说直接乱斗就好了，改小技能不会影响，还出现问题重复以上操作就好。</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"></span><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);text-align:left;font-size:24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 为了乱斗DS预设BUG删除cfg，会让<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">除了乱斗ds之外的所有ds预设以及游戏的倍速、游戏设置、游戏内是否全自动 全部初始化</span>，删了cfg的朋友一定记得都改回来，小心自己打完乱斗去竞技场手操清票发现是3倍速fa 然后输了/挂一天rd发现是auto模式没放ds全是灵车这种情况= =</span><br style=\"\"></span></div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\">\n\n</span></div></div>\n                               </div><br></span></span></span></span><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title4\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">游戏客户端优化</span></span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;通过删除文件、修改游戏内/云机的设置 提升游戏的流畅度</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;注意这些都是为了提升游戏的流畅度的设置但是多少会影响游戏的视效体验</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;建议是有需要的才修改</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:24px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;归根结底最好的优化方法就是定时重启</span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">游戏内的设置</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div></div></span><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><img data-width=\"335\" data-height=\"541\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_335/h_541/202/107952/2022/8/16/384337.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_335/h_541/202/107952/2022/8/16/384337.png\"><img data-width=\"330\" data-height=\"434\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_330/h_434/202/107952/2022/8/16/798673.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_330/h_434/202/107952/2022/8/16/798673.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">注意：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在手动PVP/竞速的情况下<span style=\"\">在战斗中隐藏过场动画这个选项可以不勾选，（勾选了释放技能的一瞬间时间还在走但是你自己的操作跟不上，勾选在释放技能的一瞬间动画效果出现的时候是有时间暂停的）如果是全自动的模式那建议勾上。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">删除角色立绘</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">安卓需要root权限；iso需要越狱并安装AFC2和FILZA两个插件</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; root/越狱 的具体方法自行百度<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></span></div><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>安卓国际服：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Android/data/com.linegames.dcglobal/files/asset/</span><span style=\"\">character</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>整个文件夹改名，下次大更前名字改回来</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Android/data/com.linegames.dcglobal/files/character</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>整个文件夹改名/删除，这里面只有一个<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center;\">绪林克斯</span>的剪影立绘删除对游戏没有任何影响</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>安卓TAP服：</span><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Android/data/<span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\">com.linegames.dcglobal.xsolla</span>/files/asset/</span><span style=\"\">character</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>改名，下次大更前名字改回来</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Android/data/<span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\">com.linegames.dcglobal.xsolla</span>/character</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>改名/删除，这里面只有一个<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">绪林克斯</span></span>的剪影立绘删除对游戏没有任何影响</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>IOS</span><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>-/var/mobile/containers/data/application/</span><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">*1</span><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\">/library/ApplicationSupport/<span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\">com.linegames.dcglobal</span>/</span><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\">dc/asset/character</span></div></span><div style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>*1 是随机字母及数字、必须找到包含此游戏的正确文件夹，<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">可以直接用filza管理器搜索</span></span><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>改名，下次大更前名字改回来</span><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></b></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>ios<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;text-align:center;\">绪林克斯的剪影的文件没找着有知道的朋友可以分享一下</span></span></b></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;text-align:center;\"><br></span></span></b></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 16px; text-align: center; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>（不过说实话 ios改了也就wb有点提升了 哈哈）</span></span></b></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>处理完这些步骤基本上就差不多了,游戏流畅度提升了那么代价是什么呢?你的老婆们的立绘就没啦</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>AY MY的朋友记得处理前去看一眼文章最后面的注意事项</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">删除特效文件、DS特效等等 <span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">（非追求极致优化的情况外不推荐）</span></span></span></span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>安卓国际服：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Android/data/<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\">com.linegames.dcglobal</span>/files/effect/battle</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>安卓TAP服：</span><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Android/data/</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">com.linegames.dcglobal.xsolla</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">/files/effect/battle</span><span style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><span style=\"\">IOS</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\"></div></span><div style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\">-/var/mobile/containers/data/application/</span><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\">*1</span><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\">/library/ApplicationSupport/<span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\">com.linegames.dcglobal</span>/</span><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\">dc/effect/<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">battle</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;*1 是随机字母及数字、必须找到包含此游戏的正确文件夹，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">可以直接用filza管理器搜索</span><br></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>battle文件夹内，<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\">留下</span>index、buff 这两个文件夹</span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">，其他文件<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">备份后删掉</span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">下次大更前改回来</span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>对游戏内特效进行优化会导致一些特效不显示问题多少有些影响游戏体验了</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">（如下图）但是是有效果的</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>一<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-style: italic;\">追求极致优化的可以尝试，一定记得备份</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img data-width=\"1170\" data-height=\"2532\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1170/h_2532/202/107952/2022/8/16/906156.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1170/h_2532/202/107952/2022/8/16/906156.PNG\" style=\"height: 631.854px; width: 291.958px;\"><img data-width=\"1170\" data-height=\"1975\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1170/h_1975/202/107952/2022/8/16/643317.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1170/h_1975/202/107952/2022/8/16/643317.PNG\" style=\"height: 511.431px; width: 302.979px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title4\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">注意事项</span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span></span></div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 关于乱斗ds预设bug：</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;为了乱斗DS预设BUG删除cfg，会让<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">除了乱斗ds之外的所有ds预设以及游戏的倍速、游戏设置、游戏内是否全自动 全部初始化</span>，删了cfg的朋友一定记得都改回来，小心自己打完乱斗去竞技场手操清票发现是3倍速fa 然后输了/挂一天rd发现是auto模式没放ds全是灵车这种情况= =</span></div></span><div style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">关于游戏其他运行优化：</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">人偶馆里生效的buff越多游戏越卡，所以一些乱七八糟收益很低的buff也没必要一直亮着可以下掉一个人偶把buff效果取消掉只留关键的buff</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">云机记得关闭省电设置，部分云机省电设置是默认打开的</span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;用安卓机喜欢折腾的朋友也可以刷ROM超超频（都有风险除了折腾党还是别尝试了）什么的也会有些帮助</div></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></div><span style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">使用<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">MY</span>的朋友需要注意的是删除了立绘</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;会导致MY无法购买浴巾/竞技场商店</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"\">其他功能</span>我用下来没有问</span>题，（<span style=\"text-align: left;\">AY貌似都没啥问题</span>）</span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 还有就是：RD期间AY MY不要删除立绘！会导致AY MY 认不出史莱姆</span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline line-through;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration-line: underline line-through;\">别在我帖子里问什么是MYAY，不知道的加个群去问！！</span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">游戏优化有个很大的作用就是</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">wb对你的伤害有些许提升，尤其是星主还是有不小的提升，尤其是那种没有集中的属性；如果你差一点点吃低保/打死星主，可以尝试，如果你差的多那也就无济于事了。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>一般情况下设备流畅度排行：</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>比较新的IOS设备＞顶配安卓手机＞顶配电脑开模拟器＞云机/低配手机</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>这里主要是因为游戏的ios客户端优化的好</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;电脑的cpu由于英特尔的虚拟化技术对比amd更胜一筹所以英特尔的体验明显更好。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;tap服的客户端优化很差，如果你执意使用tap服，出现卡顿关掉声音很有帮助</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>只要是电子设备，发热了自动降频的话肯定都卡</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>最有效的处理方法就是定时重启</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">流畅度对wb的伤害,竞技场**技能释放速度都有影响，我个人是建议云机特别卡的朋友在wb/翻盘期间可以搞一搞这套操作</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>设置里面的30fps能不开就不开，如果机器很卡那还是建议勾上</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">低画质模式一般情况不要开<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（也有说只有战斗中低画质这个选项才影响，具体可以自己尝试）</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">，低画质模式在wb会影响命中...，乱斗感觉没有太影响，不过保险起见可以不开，挂星云这种长时间系统什么的可以开低画质对手机电池友好一些</span>。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">删文件出了问题最简单的解决办法：<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">删了重下游戏</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title4\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">一些吐槽</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>这次更新的乱斗预设可以说是<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:left;\">非常</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:left;\">非常</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:left;\">非常</span>大的乱斗改动了</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;总的来说是正面优化的，...更卷了.....更吃游戏理解了</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">这个ds预设bug感觉su这个懒狗短期也不会优化了</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">不容易这次更新的好快哦</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">昨天乱斗我的</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">尤弥尔连开3大 气的我高血压 今天研究了一番 算是解决了一部分 来和朋友们分享一下</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"min-height-wrapper\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"text-align: left; min-height: 20px;\"><br></div></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span></div></div><div style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">还有就是现在竞技场防守方也套用了预设</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">（什么！我速速去设置一下狠狠坑水友）</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">，楼主也是胜率大跌，最近输的多了是正常的，本来干扰大战就存在运气因素，现在难度增加有负场很正常，兄弟们不要灰心！</span>（修复了哈哈）</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>天命之子！你还我点TS的玛瑙！！</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>尤弥尔/鲜花等: 可是我也经常打ft啊！</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>那行吧....</span></div><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"\"></span></div></span><div style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></div><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1170/h_2532/202/107952/2022/8/16/906156.PNG", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1170/h_1975/202/107952/2022/8/16/643317.PNG"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 107952, "username": "布洛芬释缓颗粒", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/25.png", "description": "就像是做了一场两年的梦", "follow_num": 29, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "暗队守望者", "tag_color": "#B138CE"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 98837191, "content_num": 19, "read_num": 125403, "like_num": 233}, "update_user": {"uid": 107952, "username": "布洛芬释缓颗粒", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/25.png", "description": "就像是做了一场两年的梦", "follow_num": 29, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 107952, "username": "布洛芬释缓颗粒", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.c